Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.57,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.73,0:00:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.99,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,733)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)\t(2277,2319,\1a&HFF&)}Luffy vs. Mr. 3
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.99,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,733)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Luffy vs. Mr. 3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru, why are you standing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to be a\Nstatue, I prefer this pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could at least\Ndo something about all this blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting nauseous just looking at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So quit looking at it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of hard to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.17,0:02:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you still think it\Nwas a bright idea to cut
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your own legs off so that\Nwe can escape from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.53,0:02:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to cut them\Noff so that we could fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, was that the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that's an even worse idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, sometimes I think you were\Nborn without any common sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're about to be turned into wax\Nstatues and the two of them are bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't seem to understand\Nthe danger of the situation at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, short guy, is that all\Nthe fight you got left in ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.43,0:02:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I'm gonna have to let\Nsomeone else take over from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't seem terribly worried about\Nwhat's going to happen to them, Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you don't seem terribly worried about\Nmaking sure it happens, Miss Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Solidify already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to die in a cool\Npose, Nami, you better hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bushido, could you please take\Nthis a little more seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, your pose could\Nuse a little work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up about the posing already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're acting so careless like this\Nfor no other reason than to mock us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though he doesn't seem to be a very\Nreliable man if you ask me, Mr. 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three Hmm we'll be happy\Nto take care of the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat pissed. Take\Ncare of him, please. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be ridiculous I sent\Nyou to take care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once already and look he's\NStanding in front of us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alive and well interfering\Nwith my artistic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,process I Think it's clear\Nthat you can't handle
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's obviously too much\Nfor you. Wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,agree you two can deal\Nwith the others if you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're up to it, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think a Straw Hat Luffy statue would make\Nan excellent addition to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've had way\Nmore than enough of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you cretins know what's\Ngood for you, you'll give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, we're safely in position now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got your back from here, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've got you. CASTLES!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.91,0:04:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.47,0:04:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I got caught already. Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.35,0:04:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's nice and heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost too simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, just once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.89,0:04:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this should be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Candle lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, giant guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is his widow doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tom, Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, the thing on my legs\Nbroke at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, but wait, why are they still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.85,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still alive, but that\Nreally didn't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one, but\Nwhy didn't you guys run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we're stuck\Nhere, isn't that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing you guys kept saying\Nwas that I needed to break the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bushido, do you really think it's a good\Nidea to put our lives in that guy's hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't exactly have\Nmuch of a choice, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I'm having a\Nlittle bit of trouble moving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move. What's happening? My body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it won't move. I can't move at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools, all you did was\Nmove the candles closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.95,0:06:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by doing so, you only sped\Nup the solidified process.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll become wax figures even sooner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy, I want to punch him\Nright in his smug little face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you guys are gonna\Nturn into Wax figures?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what we've been trying to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just hurry up and\Ndestroy this thing, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, yeah, I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wax, wax, harpoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not very flavorful. Your gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must not be too good\Nthere's no way he ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:08:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't really looking good for us\Nladies this damn thing is speeding up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.53,0:08:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I've Got my pose ready. Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Murphy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, so the pumpkin thing has to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Candle Wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would greatly appreciate it if you would
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quit interfering with\Nmy creative activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Candle, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a mallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't! Candle, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and break this\Nthing before we die up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit joking around and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit being an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not really a good time! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just do it! Not now. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just don't feel like saving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My color's trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, there's no\Ntime to space out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something about this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then quit just standing there, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.97,0:09:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I should do,\Nbut I don't feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, why do you keep saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to be turned into wax statues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:09:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to die yeah\Nbut for some reason i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't get motivated to\Nhelp what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't get motivated\Nwhat's going on here what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.81,0:10:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is wrong with him our\Nfriends are going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't do something to help them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon i'll snap him out\Nof it let's go Karoo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you two come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend has already\Nfallen into a nasty trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed what he's standing on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a strange black\Npattern on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so important about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't get it at all, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:11:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends don't\Nstand a chance of escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conney!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, now they're running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.89,0:11:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, I'm not on yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down, Karoo! Let me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bird, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.31,0:11:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me on! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a duck, not a chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Golden Week is responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that this is your doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my colors trap, Betrayal Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you touch the paint, you'll\Nwant to betray your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what they might say\Neven if they beg and plead for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help what's she talking about i\Ndon't understand what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here she's a painter she uses\Nher paint to create different
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,emotions each color is a feeling\Nher sense of color is so complete
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she can manipulate your mind just\Na splash of one of her colors
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll be under her control\Nunder her control well that's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not good that simple-minded oaf\Nis already too easy to control
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the last thing we need is someone\NI'm messing with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that all he needs to do is\Nget away from the paint and he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, move away from\Nthere, quickly! No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, please don't step\Noutside the black circle, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want you to save us, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:12:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just needed to say the exact\Nopposite of what we wanted him to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh hey? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was acting really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay I'm on my way. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, I just want\Nto laugh right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Colors trap again, laughter yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should not have\Nstepped out of the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's on his clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, quick, take off your shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now I'm too busy laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the wax keeps falling at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky to stay\Nalive for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you guys come here just to play tag?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Usopp ran into Luffy the Pink Smudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt all weird again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, painter girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop messing with me already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you were having such a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, it was kind\Nof funny, but stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to see about\Nbreaking that pumpkin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.11,0:14:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gom, gom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another color strap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for Bullfight Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.57,0:14:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't let you break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:14:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three wouldn't be happy about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During a bullfight, a bull can't\Ncontrol his urge to attack the red cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Likewise, you can't do anything\Nnow but attack that red circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.17,0:15:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.57,0:15:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that does it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm mad now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come, I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.95,0:15:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's never\Ngonna be able to beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all of his strength is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to finish up, we'll mix the laughter\Nyellow on your back with some Sadness Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last color's trap, tranquil green.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.47,0:15:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that's some good tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I told you you should've posed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you wouldn't listen to\Nme, and now it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really still talking about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, how can they just\Nkeep running like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nose Fancy, Double Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed us, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn now. Special attack. Let's start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get back to\NLuffy and the others now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chasing them around isn't\Ngetting us anywhere I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to use this on\Nuseless pests like them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like we may\Nnot have a choice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little beauty should be quite handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A .44 caliber, six-shot\Nflintlocked revolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.67,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a new model from the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Continuous fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I shoot it, the\Nbullets are invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Luffy was acting\Nso strange back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those two agents mentioned\Nsomething about paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The paint must have something\Nto do with Luffy's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was also some yellow paint on his\Nback when we crashed into him earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.59,0:17:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to do something about\Nthe paint before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really is some nice tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hey! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice tea. It's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:17:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting\Nthere and drinking tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run all you want, it's all\Nover for you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.15,0:18:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes my best trick so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special Attack: Exploding Starbler!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.01,0:18:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He missed the target and\Nhit his friend instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, that was the last of his bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breeze, breath, ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.09,0:18:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I forget to mention that\Nmy breath is also explosive?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't have any bullets to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Karoo, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you snap out of it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm good now. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he didn't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His plan this whole time was to burn the\Ncollar trap on the Straw Hat's shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your stupid paints.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let you\Nhurt any more of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time,\Nand no one's come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything could have happened\Nto Nami, Vivi, and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means that cooking this\Nlizard may have to wait for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, beautiful ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me,\Nplease just say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're mad, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.69,0:20:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being mad won't do them any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes it will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.01,0:20:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they need is some\NMiss Golden Weeks paint
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there'll be perfect\Nwax statues Face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too late to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone, and you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight is right about that Your\Nfritz are finished because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.11,0:20:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are too late to help them\Nand now it's your turn to die
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.35,0:20:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that? That thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is what he used one time to take down\Nsomeone with a 42 million barrier bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.46,0:21:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three's most dangerous work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to use your talents,\NMiss Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need an extra special\Npaint job for my armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to be artistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, can I take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why yes, you can go get some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.75,0:21:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer it if you stayed\Nout of this actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm in this armor, I'm\Nutterly impervious to harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This suit is as hard as iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be made of wax,\Nbut it fits like a glove,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's impossible for anyone to pierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you don't stand a chance against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This artwork is flawless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.39,0:21:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you admiring him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little more laughter yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right! Gah! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.89,0:21:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heat job complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:21:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now... Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champion bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.35,0:22:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harvest field maneuver!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.97,0:22:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's attacks don't work\Nagainst that guy's armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.37,0:22:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wax is choking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wax!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.03,0:22:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.11,0:22:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I realize it before now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.07,0:22:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all wax, which means\Nthat it must be able to melt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we need to use fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.19,0:22:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard it\Nis, wax is still wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.41,0:22:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others only hardened\Na few moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.55,0:22:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should still be able to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.83,0:23:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.93,0:23:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot, don't tell them that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.29,0:23:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't really matter\Nif you realize that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no hope of saving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.85,0:23:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have 30 seconds left at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, their hearts\Nwill slow to a stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.11,0:23:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we speak, their\Nwrithing in silent pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.27,0:23:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barely conscious, they're hanging\Nonto their lives by a thread,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.13,0:23:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrified of their impending\Ndoom and unable to move or even
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,speak for help and they know that\Nyou are too late to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freeze, breath, pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.07,0:23:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we say you don't stand a\Nchance, it's best to believe us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, we're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.17,0:23:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.09,0:24:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I need you to grab\Nhold of this rope, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.17,0:24:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this looks like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.41,0:24:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what are you two planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could join in on the fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.51,0:24:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.07,0:24:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just run around all the candlesticks\Nand move as quick as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I don't know why you bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.07,0:24:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.79,0:24:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you handle my crescendo stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.63,0:24:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder just how many kilograms\Nyou will be able to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.53,0:24:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.15,0:24:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three hundred kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.65,0:24:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.81,0:24:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold still, you cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.33,0:25:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.69,0:25:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.31,0:25:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brains are a permanent\Npart of my collection now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.31,0:25:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.61,0:25:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.51,0:25:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna let\Nyou have my friends, candle boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.97,0:25:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any fire, so I'm\Ngonna have to roar at yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurts, grip pulling!\NStop it! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.07,0:25:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tiny little flame isn't\Ngonna work quickly enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.07,0:25:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rope that Karoo has,\Nlight that on fire! A rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.71,0:25:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that supposed to help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.31,0:25:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this, I covered\Nthe whole thing in oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.81,0:25:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be hot, but it's the only\Nway and they should be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.61,0:26:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.93,0:26:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope the others don't get all burned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.43,0:26:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse you, you stupid straw-haired pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.75,0:26:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my precious candle set!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.31,0:26:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you show such disregard\Nfor autistic integrity!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.09,0:26:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.73,0:26:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.25,0:26:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock Baroque works, agents!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of\Nyou and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, playtime is really over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.51,0:26:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to break that scrawny little\Nneck of yours into a million paces.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.01,0:26:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand kilogram dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.07,0:26:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.45,0:26:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have thought up another plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.21,0:27:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being a little picky\Nhere, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.59,0:27:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you at least a little bit grateful?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.67,0:27:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.15,0:27:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.06,0:27:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.23,0:27:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we're actually alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.11,0:27:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got out of the wax, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.57,0:27:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.71,0:27:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We simply cannot afford for you\Nto screw up our mission anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.39,0:27:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Five!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.85,0:27:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.59,0:27:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.51,0:27:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.57,0:27:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you figured out that\Nyour pathetic explosives?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.69,0:27:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't affect me at all they're nothing\Nto an exploding man you took the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.69,0:27:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry i just told a\Nlittle lie that wasn't
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.69,0:27:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an exploding star that was\Na special tabasco star!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.45,0:27:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to learn how effective\Nthat thing was the hard way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.01,0:27:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you stupid parrot!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:28:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for a full-body explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.97,0:28:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be nothing left of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.39,0:28:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.30,0:28:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.13,0:28:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.04,0:28:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let go! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.05,0:28:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.96,0:28:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.09,0:28:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaming, holding, getting!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, these flaming\Nswords aren't too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.65,0:28:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.79,0:29:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, glad to see\Nyou made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.47,0:29:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.53,0:29:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.43,0:29:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now it seems two foes are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.59,0:29:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bird guy, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.17,0:29:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.21,0:29:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real men don't interfere\Nwith someone else's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.65,0:29:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.77,0:29:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.73,0:29:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my Wax Wax Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.39,0:29:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.95,0:29:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, just a little game of hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.93,0:29:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you figure out which one is me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.91,0:29:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say it appears you picked the\Nwrong group of people to go up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match for my intellectual\Nprowess and artistic abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.91,0:30:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just another buffoon\Nwho acts on blind instinct
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.99,0:30:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and uses brute force to\Nsolve all his problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.89,0:30:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hope to catch an\Nintellectual giant like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a Baroque Works agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.63,0:30:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every assignment that is given\Nto me I see through to its end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.57,0:30:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you think you're ready,\Nthen just step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.43,0:30:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, just take a little step.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.17,0:30:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as soon as your back is\Nturned, I'm going to stab you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right through that pathetically\Nnoble little heart of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.41,0:30:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you have known\Nthat this is where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.09,0:31:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.99,0:31:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.93,0:31:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be sitting here all relaxed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.83,0:31:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just casually sipping tea without\Na single care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.91,0:31:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, Vivi,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.82,0:31:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the others could be waiting out there\Nright now for me to come and help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:32:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still curious\Nabout one thing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.79,0:32:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is a nice, relaxing place like this\Ndoing smack in the middle of an ancient,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.27,0:32:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creepy jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.89,0:32:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.07,0:32:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.25,0:32:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.87,0:32:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.79,0:32:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've reached the crap cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.83,0:32:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.85,0:32:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can quit fooling around now, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.15,0:32:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, your report's a little\Nbit late, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.63,0:32:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.57,0:32:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My report, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to whom exactly am I speaking, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.97,0:33:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Mr. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.09,0:33:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a treasure I better be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.51,0:33:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds that you'll find\Nit will slip to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.85,0:33:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's such a big\Nplace, the oceans are wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.19,0:33:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at home.\NWon't help you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up your time, spend on the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.41,0:33:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.37,0:33:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone tries to keep\Nus from moving home,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.55,0:33:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The factor behind our\Nbacks just keeps us strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.83,0:33:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad, cause we're\Nstill selling for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So fun for ya, just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.67,0:33:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be foolish,\Nchasing impossible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.47,0:33:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've just gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.01,0:33:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crazier the dream, the\Nmore ambition I've gotta need.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.15,0:34:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be for this drive and home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.97,0:34:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know that I've just gotta buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.31,0:34:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The farther the sea, the greater paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.27,0:34:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta find!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be about just people trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.67,0:34:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you see that you've loved you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horizon of your dreams?

